#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:4
msgid "Сервисы Docker"
msgstr "Docker Services"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:6
msgid ""
"Раздел описывает Docker-образы, входящие в состав платформы Citeck: "
"назначение каждого сервиса, шаблон его описания в docker-compose, "
"используемые переменные окружения и типовой вид лога успешного запуска."
msgstr ""
"This section describes the Docker images included in the Citeck platform: "
"the purpose of each service, the template of its description in docker-"
"compose, the environment variables used, and a typical successful startup "
"log."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:11
msgid "onlyoffice-ds-app"
msgstr "onlyoffice-ds-app"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:15
msgid ""
"Образ, включающий набор инструментов для развертывания OnlyOffice "
"Document Server."
msgstr ""
"An image that includes a set of tools for deploying the OnlyOffice "
"Document Server."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:17
msgid "ecos-gateway-app"
msgstr "ecos-gateway-app"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:21
msgid ""
"Образ одного из центральных компонентов микросервисной архитектуры — "
"API-шлюз взаимодействия с остальными микросервисами."
msgstr ""
"Image of one of the central components of the microservice architecture — "
"an API gateway for interacting with the other microservices."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:23
msgid "ecos-notifications-app"
msgstr "ecos-notifications-app"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:27
msgid "Образ микросервиса рассылки нотификаций."
msgstr "Image of the notification dispatch microservice."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:29
msgid "ecos-mongo-app"
msgstr "ecos-mongo-app"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:33
msgid ""
"Образ для развертывания контейнера с MongoDB с преконфигурированными "
"настройками датасорсов для микросервисов."
msgstr ""
"Image for deploying a MongoDB container with preconfigured datasource "
"settings for the microservices."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:35
msgid "mailhog-app"
msgstr "mailhog-app"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:39
msgid "Образ инструмента для e-mail тестирования."
msgstr "Image of a tool for e-mail testing."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:41
msgid "ecos-postgresql-app"
msgstr "ecos-postgresql-app"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:45
msgid ""
"Образ на базе PostgreSQL 9.4.x со скриптом инициализации баз данных и "
"пользователей."
msgstr ""
"Image based on PostgreSQL 9.4.x with a database and user initialization "
"script."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:47
msgid "ecos-model-app"
msgstr "ecos-model-app"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:51
msgid ""
"Образ микросервиса для хранения и работы с сущностями модели данных: тип,"
" раздел, ассоциация, действие."
msgstr ""
"Image of the microservice for storing and working with data model "
"entities: type, section, association, action."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:53
msgid "ecos-integrations-app"
msgstr "ecos-integrations-app"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:57
msgid ""
"Микросервис, предоставляющий эндпойнт ecos-records для запросов к внешним"
" системам."
msgstr ""
"Microservice that provides the ecos-records endpoint for requests to "
"external systems."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:59
msgid "ecos-proxy-app"
msgstr "ecos-proxy-app"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:63
msgid "Образ проксирующего сервера со сборкой проекта ecos-ui."
msgstr "Image of the proxy server with the ecos-ui project build."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:65
msgid "ecos-uiserv-app"
msgstr "ecos-uiserv-app"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:69
msgid ""
"Образ микросервиса, предоставляющего элементы UI и хранящего их "
"настройки: меню, журналы, конфиги, формы, дашборды."
msgstr ""
"Image of the microservice that provides UI elements and stores their "
"settings: menus, journals, configs, forms, dashboards."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:71
msgid "ecos-process-app"
msgstr "ecos-process-app"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:75
msgid "Образ микросервиса для управления бизнес-процессами."
msgstr "Image of the microservice for managing business processes."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:77
msgid "ecos-microservices-postgresql-app"
msgstr "ecos-microservices-postgresql-app"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:81
msgid ""
"Образ на базе PostgreSQL 12.x со скриптом инициализации баз данных и "
"пользователей для микросервисов."
msgstr ""
"Image based on PostgreSQL 12.x with a database and user initialization "
"script for the microservices."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:83
msgid "ecos-history-app"
msgstr "ecos-history-app"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:87
msgid ""
"Образ микросервиса для хранения истории, статистики по задачам и фасада "
"атрибутов."
msgstr ""
"Image of the microservice for storing history, task statistics, and the "
"attribute facade."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:89
msgid "rabbitmq-app"
msgstr "rabbitmq-app"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:93
msgid "Образ брокера сообщений RabbitMQ."
msgstr "Image of the RabbitMQ message broker."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:95
msgid "ecos-apps-app"
msgstr "ecos-apps-app"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:99
msgid "Образ микросервиса, управляющего деплоем приложений и модулей ECOS."
msgstr ""
"Image of the microservice that manages the deployment of ECOS "
"applications and modules."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:101
msgid "eis (Keycloak)"
msgstr "eis (Keycloak)"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services.rst:105
msgid ""
"Сервис аутентификации и авторизации (IAM) на основе Keycloak: SSO, "
"управление пользователями, ролями и группами."
msgstr ""
"Authentication and authorization (IAM) service based on Keycloak: SSO, "
"user, role, and group management."

